      "writtenOn": "2023-05-31T17:01:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay, so as of now vts doesn\u0027t add virtual connections in the attachedDevicesPorts.\nDo we need to add out_submix device to the list?",
      "parentUuid": "f0270c59_7dea6b20",
      "range": {
